  "label": "Holocaust denial/minimization themes",
  "description": "A form of antisemitic trope that downplays or denies the Holocaust, often by trivializing its scale and horror. This meme uses a similar harmful rhetorical strategy by minimizing the catastrophic human suffering of the atomic bombings, reducing it to a joke about friendship. This is a form of historical minimization.",
